\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {II}{\ignorespaces Zero-shot cross-sensor AUROC. \emph  {IRDS-only} columns: the SSL encoder is pretrained on the $\sim $1k unlabeled IRDS sequences, then evaluated over all 77 KIMORE LOSO fold models (mean with 95\% CI in parentheses; D = degenerate). \emph  {All-corpora} columns: the SSL encoder is pretrained on the pooled $\sim $5k unlabeled sequences of IRDS + KIMORE + REHAB246 + UI-PRMD (target corpora enter as unlabeled pretraining data only --- never with labels), then fine-tuned on all labeled KIMORE data as a single model. In both settings only KIMORE supplies supervision. Every CI excludes 0.55 and lies far below the naive baseline. The naive kinematic baseline is direct AUROC of path-length and speed features (no model trained). CORAL fits a domain-aligned logistic regression on scratch TCN features from KIMORE.}}{4}{table.2}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:zeroshot}{{II}{4}{Zero-shot cross-sensor AUROC. \emph {IRDS-only} columns: the SSL encoder is pretrained on the $\sim $1k unlabeled IRDS sequences, then evaluated over all 77 KIMORE LOSO fold models (mean with 95\% CI in parentheses; D = degenerate). \emph {All-corpora} columns: the SSL encoder is pretrained on the pooled $\sim $5k unlabeled sequences of IRDS + KIMORE + REHAB246 + UI-PRMD (target corpora enter as unlabeled pretraining data only --- never with labels), then fine-tuned on all labeled KIMORE data as a single model. In both settings only KIMORE supplies supervision. Every CI excludes 0.55 and lies far below the naive baseline. The naive kinematic baseline is direct AUROC of path-length and speed features (no model trained). CORAL fits a domain-aligned logistic regression on scratch TCN features from KIMORE}{table.2}{}}
